            </p>
            <p>
                As a freelance AI engineer with a strong foundation in academic
                research, I help companies in bridging the gap between cutting-edge
                AI research (yes, also those fancy agentic pipelines) and  
                <strong> real-world, reliability-first, applications</strong>.

                <!-- I help companies and individuals leverage the power of artificial
                intelligence to solve complex problems and create innovative
                solutions. With a strong background in machine learning and deep
                learning, I specialize in developing custom AI models and
                applications that drive business growth and efficiency. -->
