                I also spent a semester at University of Glasgow (UK) as part of the <a class="outlinks after:content-['_↗']" href="https://socialcdt.org/">Social AI CDT</a> in collaboration with prof. Alessandro Vinciarelli.
                My research interests focused primarily on <strong>pose estimation, social signal processing and multi-task learning</strong>. 
                I investigated, for instance, automatic systems that can understand how people move in the space and how they interact with each other. 
            </p>
